.Sh HISTORY
.Fn OSSL_STORE_delete
was added in OpenSSL 3.2.
.Pp
.Fn OSSL_STORE_open_ex
was added in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
.Vt OSSL_STORE_CTX ,
OSSL_STORE_post_process_info_fn(),
.Fn OSSL_STORE_open ,
.Fn OSSL_STORE_ctrl ,
.Fn OSSL_STORE_load ,
.Fn OSSL_STORE_eof
and
.Fn OSSL_STORE_close
